\u0645\\u060c \\u0644\\u062d\\u0646\\u064b\\u0627 \\u062a\\u0644\\u0648 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0622\\u062e\\u0631."},"fr":{"item_name":"Sarah \\u00c9t\\u00e9s","item_designation":"Maestro des m\\u00e9lodies du matin","item_about":"Sarah Summers est une musicienne et compositrice talentueuse, connue pour ses m\\u00e9lodies matinales enchanteresses qui \\u00e9l\\u00e8vent et inspirent. Passionn\\u00e9e par la cr\\u00e9ation de m\\u00e9lodies apaisantes et harmonieuses, elle a gagn\\u00e9 le titre de \\u00ab Morning Melodies Maestro \\u00bb pour sa capacit\\u00e9 \\u00e0 transformer des matins ordinaires en exp\\u00e9riences extraordinaires gr\\u00e2ce \\u00e0 la musique.\\r\\n\\r\\nQu\'elle se produise en live, qu\'elle compose des morceaux originaux ou qu\'elle encadre des musiciens en herbe, Sarah apporte chaleur et cr\\u00e9ativit\\u00e9 \\u00e0 tout ce qu\'elle fait. Son travail a \\u00e9t\\u00e9 pr\\u00e9sent\\u00e9 sur de nombreuses plateformes, des playlists matinales paisibles aux retraites de bien-\\u00eatre, o\\u00f9 ses m\\u00e9lodies donnent le ton pour un d\\u00e9but de journ\\u00e9e parfait.\\r\\n\\r\\nMotiv\\u00e9e par son amour pour la musique et son d\\u00e9sir de se connecter avec les gens, Sarah Summers continue d\'inspirer le public du monde entier, une m\\u00e9lodie \\u00e0 la fois."}},"id":"6604ffe0e212e","image":"8a10ed4b-b341-48ba-aa4b-7116a1c0ea67.webp","social_links":[{"id":"6604ffe0ebe58","icon_image":"0ce32b09-b99b-44e7-b6f9-b639ea147e8e.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/"},{"id":"6604ffe0ef084","icon_image":"7d83022c-17f9-4788-8f1b-b28fadc8d3de.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/twitter.com\\/"},{"id":"6604ffe100394","icon_image":"4a21e089-1e3a-45e7-b543-4ddaef3f7e1b.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/"},{"id":"6604ffe1068d6","icon_image":"1c16858d-b3bd-43ac-b014-a117007c9fde.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/"}]},"6605004f0fbbf":{"language":{"en":{"item_name":"Emily Roberts","item_designation":"Nostalgia Curator","item_about":"Emily Roberts is a storyteller and creator who specializes in weaving the magic of the past into the present. As the \\"Nostalgia Curator,\\" Emily has a unique talent for rekindling cherished memories and emotions through her art, whether it\\u2019s in the form of writing, photography, or digital media. Her work celebrates the beauty of timeless moments, inspiring audiences to reflect on the stories that shape their lives.\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom curating vintage-inspired collections to crafting heartfelt narratives that evoke a sense of longing and wonder, Emily\'s creations are a bridge to the past. Her passion for preserving and sharing nostalgic treasures has made her a beloved figure in creative and cultural circles.\\r\\n\\r\\nEmily believes in the power of nostalgia to connect generations, spark joy, and bring comfort in an ever-changing world. With a heart full of stories and an eye for timeless beauty, she continues to inspire others to find magic in their own histories."},"es":{"item_name":"Emily Roberts","item_designation":"Curador de nostalgia","item_about":"Emily Roberts es una narradora y creadora que se especializa en tejer la magia del pasado en el presente. Como \\"curadora de la nostalgia\\", Emily tiene un talento \\u00fanico para reavivar recuerdos y emociones preciados a trav\\u00e9s de su arte, ya sea en forma de escritura, fotograf\\u00eda o medios digitales. Su trabajo celebra la belleza de los momentos atemporales, inspirando al p\\u00fablico a reflexionar sobre las historias que dan forma a sus vidas.\\r\\n\\r\\nDesde la curadur\\u00eda de colecciones inspiradas en lo vintage hasta la creaci\\u00f3n de narrativas sinceras que evocan una sensaci\\u00f3n de a\\u00f1oranza y asombro, las creaciones de Emily son un puente hacia el pasado. Su pasi\\u00f3n por preservar y compartir tesoros nost\\u00e1lgicos la ha convertido en una figura querida en los c\\u00edrculos creativos y culturales.\\r\\n\\r\\nEmily cree en el poder de la nostalgia para conectar generaciones, generar alegr\\u00eda y brindar consuelo en un mundo en constante cambio. Con un coraz\\u00f3n lleno de historias y un ojo para la belleza atemporal, contin\\u00faa inspirando a otros a encontrar la magia en sus propias historias."},"hi":{"item_name":"\\u090f\\u092e\\u093f\\u0932\\u0940 \\u0930\\u0949\\u092c\\u0930\\u094d\\u091f\\u094d\\u0938","item_designation":"\\u0928\\u0949\\u0938\\u094d\\u091f\\u0947\\u0932\\u094d\\u091c\\u093f\\u092f\\u093e \\u0915\\u094d\\u092f\\u0942\\u0930\\u0947\\u091f\\u0930","item_about":"\\u090f\\u092e\\u093f\\u0932\\u0940 \\u0930\\u0949\\u092c\\u0930\\u094d\\u091f\\u094d\\u0938 \\u090f\\u0915 \\u0915\\u0939\\u093e\\u0928\\u0940\\u0915\\u093e\\u0930 \\u0914\\u0930 \\u0930\\u091a\\u0928\\u093e\\u0915\\u093e\\u0930 \\u0939\\u0948\\u0902 \\u091c\\u094b \\u0905\\u0924\\u0940\\u0924 \\u0915\\u0947 \\u091c\\u093e\\u0926\\u0942 \\u0915\\u094b \\u0935\\u0930\\u094d\\u0924\\u092e\\u093e\\u0928 \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u092c\\u0941\\u0928\\u0928\\u0947 \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902 \\u092e\\u093e\\u0939\\u093f\\u0930 \\u0939\\u0948\\u0902\\u0964 \\"\\u0928\\u0949\\u0938\\u094d\\u091f\\u0948\\u0932\\u094d\\u091c\\u093f\\u092f\\u093e \\u0915\\u094d\\u092f\\u0942\\u0930\\u0947\\u091f\\u0930\\" \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0930\\u0942\\u092a \\u092e\\u0947\\u0902, \\u090f\\u092e\\u093f\\u0932\\u0940 \\u0915\\u0947 \\u092a\\u093e\\u0938 \\u0905\\u092a\\u0928\\u0940 \\u0915\\u0932\\u093e \\u0915\\u0947 \\u092e\\u093e\\u0927\\u094d\\u092f\\u092e \\u0938\\u0947 \\u092a\\u094b\\u0937\\u093f\\u0924 \\u092f\\u093e\\u0926\\u094b\\u0902 \\u0914\\u0930 \\u092d\\u093e\\u0935\\u0928\\u093e\\u0913\\u0902 \\u0915\\u094b \\u092b\\u093f\\u0930 \\u0938\\u0947 \\u091c\\u0917\\u093e\\u0928\\u0947 \\u0915\\u0940 \\u090f\\u0915 \\u0905\\u0928\\u0942\\u0920\\u0940 \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u0924\\u093f\\u092d\\u093e \\u0939\\u0948, \\u091a\\u093e\\u0939\\u0947 \\u0935\\u0939 \\u0932\\u0947\\u0916\\u0928, \\u092b\\u094b\\u091f\\u094b\\u0917\\u094d\\u0930\\u093e\\u092b\\u0940 