s cr\\u00e9atifs et culturels.\\r\\n\\r\\nEmily croit au pouvoir de la nostalgie pour relier les g\\u00e9n\\u00e9rations, susciter la joie et apporter du r\\u00e9confort dans un monde en constante \\u00e9volution. Avec un c\\u0153ur plein d\'histoires et un \\u0153il pour la beaut\\u00e9 intemporelle, elle continue d\'inspirer les autres \\u00e0 trouver la magie dans leur propre histoire."}},"id":"6605004f0fbbf","image":"9813a38a-9df3-4910-a3b9-4ab7b1956d16.webp","social_links":[{"id":"6605004f18b5b","icon_image":"63cf7afb-f0ff-49c1-9e2d-f892d21490cd.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/"},{"id":"6605004f1b16f","icon_image":"f8ef17da-e12a-4fdd-a24c-4d250b65cca2.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/twitter.com\\/"},{"id":"6605004f1fa1d","icon_image":"f1c7fbbd-64bd-4808-bd29-a364a4654b1f.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/"},{"id":"6605004f22bfd","icon_image":"328ecb77-5da4-4c7b-8b2d-d8b5ed1c7a75.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/"}]},"660507914cb90":{"language":{"en":{"item_name":"Alex Rivers","item_designation":"Indie Spotlight Navigator","item_about":"Alex Rivers is a passionate advocate for independent artists and creators, shining a light on emerging talent across music, film, art, and beyond. As the \\"Indie Spotlight Navigator,\\" Alex has an innate ability to discover hidden gems and guide audiences toward the raw, unfiltered creativity of the indie world.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith a background in creative curation and a deep love for storytelling, Alex bridges the gap between talented creators and those eager to explore fresh, innovative perspectives. Through insightful reviews, interviews, and expertly crafted playlists, Alex has become a trusted voice for those seeking to connect with authentic and boundary-pushing artistry.\\r\\n\\r\\nBelieving that indie creators are the heartbeat of innovation, Alex Rivers dedicates their work to elevating their stories and ensuring their voices are heard. With a keen eye for talent and a passion for the unconventional, Alex continues to redefine how we discover and celebrate the independent scene."},"es":{"item_name":"Alex R\\u00edos","item_designation":"Navegador independiente destacado","item_about":"Alex Rivers es un apasionado defensor de los artistas y creadores independientes, que destaca el talento emergente en la m\\u00fasica, el cine, el arte y m\\u00e1s. Como \\"Indie Spotlight Navigator\\", Alex tiene una habilidad innata para descubrir joyas ocultas y guiar al p\\u00fablico hacia la creatividad cruda y sin filtros del mundo indie.\\r\\n\\r\\nCon experiencia en curadur\\u00eda creativa y un profundo amor por la narraci\\u00f3n, Alex cierra la brecha entre los creadores talentosos y aquellos ansiosos por explorar perspectivas nuevas e innovadoras. A trav\\u00e9s de rese\\u00f1as perspicaces, entrevistas y listas de reproducci\\u00f3n elaboradas por expertos, Alex se ha convertido en una voz confiable para aquellos que buscan conectarse con el arte aut\\u00e9ntico y que traspasa los l\\u00edmites.\\r\\n\\r\\nCon la convicci\\u00f3n de que los creadores independientes son el coraz\\u00f3n de la innovaci\\u00f3n, Alex Rivers dedica su trabajo a elevar sus historias y garantizar que sus voces sean escuchadas. Con un ojo agudo para el talento y una pasi\\u00f3n por lo poco convencional, Alex contin\\u00faa redefiniendo c\\u00f3mo descubrimos y celebramos la escena independiente."},"hi":{"item_name":"\\u090f\\u0932\\u0947\\u0915\\u094d\\u0938 \\u0930\\u093f\\u0935\\u0930","item_designation":"\\u0907\\u0902\\u0921\\u0940 \\u0938\\u094d\\u092a\\u0949\\u091f\\u0932\\u093e\\u0907\\u091f \\u0928\\u0947\\u0935\\u093f\\u0917\\u0947\\u091f\\u0930","item_about":"\\u090f\\u0932\\u0947\\u0915\\u094d\\u0938 \\u0930\\u093f\\u0935\\u0930\\u094d\\u0938 \\u0938\\u094d\\u0935\\u0924\\u0902\\u0924\\u094d\\u0930 \\u0915\\u0932\\u093e\\u0915\\u093e\\u0930\\u094b\\u0902 \\u0914\\u0930 \\u0930\\u091a\\u0928\\u093e\\u0915\\u093e\\u0930\\u094b\\u0902 \\u0915\\u0947 \\u090f\\u0915 \\u092d\\u093