0639 \\u0627\\u062d\\u062a\\u0631\\u0627\\u0645\\u0647 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0645\\u064a\\u0642 \\u0644\\u062a\\u0627\\u0631\\u064a\\u062e \\u0645\\u0648\\u0633\\u064a\\u0642\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0627\\u0632 \\u0648\\u0646\\u0647\\u062c\\u0647 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0634\\u062c\\u0627\\u0639 \\u062a\\u062c\\u0627\\u0647 \\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0642\\u0628\\u0644\\u0647\\u0627\\u060c \\u064a\\u0638\\u0644 \\u0645\\u0627\\u064a\\u0643\\u0644 \\u062f\\u064a\\u0641\\u064a\\u0633 \\u0645\\u0646\\u0627\\u0631\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0634\\u0631\\u0642\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0639\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0627\\u0632 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u062a\\u0637\\u0648\\u0631 \\u0628\\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0645\\u0631\\u0627\\u0631."},"fr":{"item_name":"Michael Davis","item_designation":"Jazz virtuose","item_about":"Michael Davis est un musicien magistral dont les rythmes soul et le g\\u00e9nie de l\'improvisation lui ont valu le titre de \\u00ab virtuose du jazz \\u00bb. Avec une carri\\u00e8re qui s\'\\u00e9tend sur des d\\u00e9cennies, Michael est devenu une figure v\\u00e9n\\u00e9r\\u00e9e dans le monde du jazz, captivant le public avec ses performances dynamiques et ses compositions sinc\\u00e8res.\\r\\n\\r\\nDes clubs de jazz intimes aux grandes salles de concert, la musique de Michael transcende les fronti\\u00e8res, m\\u00e9langeant le jazz traditionnel aux influences modernes pour cr\\u00e9er un son qui lui est propre. Son talent au saxophone (ou \\u00e0 l\'instrument appropri\\u00e9) et sa capacit\\u00e9 \\u00e0 se connecter \\u00e9motionnellement avec les auditeurs ont consolid\\u00e9 sa place parmi les grands du genre.\\r\\n\\r\\nLe d\\u00e9vouement de Michael au jazz s\'\\u00e9tend au-del\\u00e0 de la sc\\u00e8ne. En tant que mentor, il nourrit la prochaine g\\u00e9n\\u00e9ration de musiciens et en tant que compositeur, ses \\u0153uvres continuent d\'inspirer et d\'innover. Avec un profond respect pour l\'histoire du jazz et une approche sans peur de son avenir, Michael Davis reste un phare brillant dans le monde en constante \\u00e9volution du jazz."}},"id":"660508015067b","image":"be29204d-260c-49c9-9ed7-b0297c949ea7.webp","social_links":[{"id":"660508015aca6","icon_image":"49bae661-5440-420c-a5f9-21c0ffb9327f.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/"},{"id":"660508015dfac","icon_image":"adb04040-79d4-45df-93fc-70c09cb0140d.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/twitter.com\\/"},{"id":"66050801628ff","icon_image":"4567ed04-e592-4546-82f3-50618989569a.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/"},{"id":"6605080165e3f","icon_image":"095bc381-5670-4e23-ad3f-7ebf4aab94e4.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/"}]},"660508a930e6f":{"language":{"en":{"item_name":"Olivia Mason","item_designation":"Evening Chillout Guru","item_about":"Olivia Mason is a celebrated curator of calm, known for crafting the perfect soundtrack to unwind after a long day. As the \\"Evening Chillout Guru,\\" Olivia blends her love for soothing melodies with her expertise in creating tranquil atmospheres, making her a go-to figure for anyone seeking relaxation and balance.\\r\\n\\r\\nWhether through her curated playlists, live sets, or serene compositions, Olivia\\u2019s work embodies the art of slowing down and embracing the moment. Her talent lies in seamlessly weaving together mellow tunes, ambient sounds, and soulful rhythms that transform any evening into a peaceful escape.\\r\\n\\r\\nBeyond her music, Olivia is a vocal advocate for self-care and mindfulness, often collaborating with wellness brands and hosting events that promote harmony and well-being. With her gentle approach and deep understanding of the power of music, Olivia Mason helps her audience end their days on a soothing and rejuvenating note."},"es":{"item_name":"Olivia Mason","item_designation":"Gur\\u00fa del chillout nocturno","item_about":"Olivia Mason es una c\\u00e9lebre curadora de la calma, conocida por crear la banda sonora perfecta para relajarse despu\\u00e9s de un largo d\\u00eda. Como la \\"gur\\u00fa del relax nocturno\\", Olivia combina su amor por las melod\\u00edas relajantes con su experiencia en la creaci\\u00f3n de atm\\u00f3sferas tranquilas, lo que la convierte en una figura de referencia para cualquiera que busque relajaci\\u00f3n y equilibrio.\\r\\n\\r\\nYa sea a trav\\u00e9s de sus listas de reproducci\\u00f3n seleccionadas, sets en vivo o composiciones serenas, el trabajo de Olivia encarna el arte de bajar el ritmo y abrazar el momento. Su talento radica en combinar a la perfecci\\u00f3n melod\\u00edas suaves, sonidos ambientales y ritmos conmovedores que transforman cualquier noche en una escapada pac\\u00edfica.\\r\\n\\r\\nM\\u00e1s all\\u00e1 de su m\\u00fasica, Olivia es una defensora vocal del autocuidado y la atenci\\u00f3n plena, y a menudo colabora con marcas de bienestar y organiza eventos que promueven la armon\\u00eda y el bienestar. Con su enfoque amable y su profundo conocimiento del poder de la m\\u00fasica, Olivia Mason ayuda a su audiencia a terminar sus d\\u00edas con una nota relajante y rejuvenecedora."},"hi":{"item_name":"\\u0913\\u0932\\u093f\\u0935\\u093f\\u092f\\u093e \\u092e\\u0947\\u0938\\u0928","item_designation":"\\u0907\\u0935\\u0928\\u093f\\u0902\\u0917 \\u091a\\u093f\\u0932\\u0906\\u0909\\u091f \\u0917\\u0941\\u0930\\u0941","item_about":"\\u0913\\u0932\\u093f\\u0935\\u093f\\u092f\\u093e \\u092e\\u0947\\u0938\\u0928 \\u0936\\u093e\\u0902\\u0924\\u093f \\u0915\\u0940 \\u090f\\u0915 \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u0938\\u093f\\u0926\\u094d\\u0927 \\u0915\\u094d\\u092f\\u0942\\u0930\\u0947\\u091f\\u0930 \\u0939\\u0948\\u0902, \\u091c\\u093f\\u0928\\u094d\\u0939\\u0947\\u0902 \\u090f\\u0915 \\u0932\\u0902\\u092c\\u0947 \\u0926\\u093f\\u0928 \\u0915\\u0947 \\u092c\\u093e\\u0926 \\u0906\\u0930\\u093e\\u092e \\u0915\\u0930\\u0928\\u0947 \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0932\\u093f\\u090f \\u090f\\u0915\\u0926\\u092e \\u0938\\u0939\\u0940 \\u0938\\u093e\\u0909\\u0902\\u0921\\u091f\\u094d\\u0930\\u0948\\u0915 \\u