Chris Taylor","item_designation":"Passionn\\u00e9 de hits pop","item_about":"Chris Taylor est un passionn\\u00e9 de musique dynamique, anim\\u00e9 d\'une passion sans pareille pour la musique pop. En tant que \\u00ab Pop Hits Enthusiast \\u00bb, Chris apporte une \\u00e9nergie contagieuse \\u00e0 la c\\u00e9l\\u00e9bration des plus grands succ\\u00e8s et des joyaux cach\\u00e9s du monde de la pop. Avec une connaissance encyclop\\u00e9dique du genre et un doigt sur le pouls des tendances actuelles, Chris est une voix de confiance pour les m\\u00e9lomanes du monde entier.\\r\\n\\r\\nDe la dissection des derniers singles \\u00e0 succ\\u00e8s \\u00e0 la revisitation de classiques embl\\u00e9matiques, Chris partage des id\\u00e9es, des critiques et des playlists organis\\u00e9es qui mettent en valeur le meilleur de la musique pop. Qu\'il s\'agisse de d\\u00e9composer des paroles accrocheuses, d\'explorer les histoires derri\\u00e8re les chansons ou de d\\u00e9fendre des artistes pop \\u00e9mergents, l\'enthousiasme de Chris est \\u00e0 la fois engageant et inspirant.\\r\\n\\r\\nV\\u00e9ritable partisan de l\'attrait universel de la pop, Chris Taylor relie les gens \\u00e0 travers la joie de la musique, prouvant qu\'une bonne chanson pop a le pouvoir de rassembler tout le monde. Gr\\u00e2ce \\u00e0 son travail, Chris continue de diffuser la magie des tubes pop aux fans du monde entier."}},"id":"6605092e6262b","image":"653e3ff0-4bc8-4b2d-9910-0ca9890cc4f2.webp","social_links":[{"id":"6605092e6bfcd","icon_image":"e8786842-3b22-4a8a-aeb1-76732eca05db.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/"},{"id":"6605092e6eb28","icon_image":"3004ef8a-4d76-4dd7-a343-8bfb4723e3b5.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/twitter.com\\/"},{"id":"6605092e7228d","icon_image":"70a56938-5def-45a8-af94-66a41fd8735a.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/"},{"id":"6605092e75498","icon_image":"948ce820-e1db-4af7-8ecd-423307c4d762.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/"}]},"66050a0fa823d":{"language":{"en":{"item_name":"Lily Anderson","item_designation":"Acoustic Virtuoso","item_about":"Lily Anderson is a gifted musician whose mastery of acoustic instruments has earned her the title of \\"Acoustic Virtuoso.\\" Known for her heartfelt performances and intricate techniques, Lily creates music that resonates deeply with audiences, blending raw emotion with impeccable artistry.\\r\\n\\r\\nSpecializing in acoustic guitar (or another instrument), Lily\\u2019s music transcends genres, weaving together folk, classical, and contemporary influences into a sound that is uniquely her own. Whether performing on stage, recording in the studio, or teaching aspiring musicians, Lily\\u2019s passion for the acoustic medium shines through in everything she does.\\r\\n\\r\\nHer compositions, characterized by their soulful melodies and rich harmonies, have captivated listeners around the world, earning her accolades from fans and critics alike. Dedicated to preserving the beauty of acoustic music while pushing its boundaries, Lily Anderson continues to inspire, one string and one note at a time."},"es":{"item_name":"lily anderson","item_designation":"Virtuoso ac\\u00fastico","item_about":"Lily Anderson es una talentosa m\\u00fasica cuyo dominio de los instrumentos ac\\u00fasticos le ha valido el t\\u00edtulo de \\"Virtuosa ac\\u00fastica\\". Conocida por sus sentidas interpretaciones y sus intrincadas t\\u00e9cnicas, Lily crea m\\u00fasica que resuena profundamente en el p\\u00fablico, combinando emoci\\u00f3n cruda con un arte impecable.\\r\\n\\r\\nEspecializada en guitarra ac\\u00fastica (u otro instrumento), la m\\u00fasica de Lily trasciende g\\u00e9neros, entrelazando influencias folcl\\u00f3ricas, cl\\u00e1sicas y contempor\\u00e1neas en un sonido que es exclusivamente suyo. Ya sea que act\\u00fae en el escenario, grabe en el estudio o ense\\u00f1e a m\\u00fasicos aspirantes, la pasi\\u00f3n de Lily por el medio ac\\u00fastico brilla en todo lo que hace.\\r\\n\\r\\nSus composiciones, caracterizadas por sus melod\\u00edas conmovedoras y sus ricas armon\\u00edas, han cautivado a oyentes de todo el mundo, lo que le ha valido elogios de los fan\\u00e1ticos y los cr\\u00edticos por igual. Dedicada a preservar la belleza de la m\\u00fasica ac\\u00fastica mientras ampl\\u00eda sus l\\u00edmites, Lily Anderson contin\\u00faa inspirando, una cuerda y una nota a la vez."},"hi":{"item_name":"\\u0932\\u093f\\u0932\\u0940 \\u090f\\u0902\\u0921\\u0930\\u0938\\u0928","item_designation":"\\u0927\\u094d\\u0935\\u0928\\u093f\\u0915 \\u0915\\u0932\\u093e\\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u0935\\u0940\\u0923 \\u0935\\u094d\\u092f\\u0915\\u094d\\u0924\\u093f","item_about":"\\u0932\\u093f\\u0932\\u0940 \\u090f\\u0902\\u0921\\u0930\\u0938\\u0928 \\u090f\\u0915 \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u0924\\u093f\\u092d\\u093e\\u0936\\u093e\\u0932\\u0940 \\u0938\\u0902\\u0917\\u0940\\u0924\\u0915\\u093e\\u0930 \\u0939\\u0948\\u0902, \\u091c\\u093f\\u0928\\u0915\\u0940 \\u0927\\u094d\\u0935\\u0928\\u093f\\u0915 \\u0909\\u092a\\u0915\\u0930\\u0923\\u094b\\u0902 \\u092a\\u0930 \\u092e\\u0939\\u093e\\u0930\\u0924 \\u0928\\u0947 \\u0909\\u0928\\u094d\\u0939\\u0947\\u0902 \\"\\u0927\\u094d\\u0935\\u0928\\u093f\\u0915 \\u0915\\u0932\\u093e\\u0915\\u093e\\u0930\\" \\u0915\\u0940 \\u0909\\u092a\\u093e\\u0927\\u093f \\u0926\\u093f\\u0932\\u093e\\u0908 \\u0939\\u0948\\u0964 \\u0905\\u092a\\u0928\\u0947 \\u0926\\u093f\\u0932 \\u0915\\u094b \\u091b\\u0942 \\u0932\\u0947\\u0928\\u0947 \\u0935\\u093e\\u0932\\u0947 \\u092a\\u094d\\u0930\\u0926\\u0930\\u094d\\u0936\\u0928\\u094b\\u0902 \\u0914\\u0930 \\u091c\\u091f\\u093f\\u0932 \\u0924\\u0915\\u0928\\u0940\\u0915\\u094b\\u0902 \\u0915\\u0947 \\u0932\\u093f\\u090f \\u091c\\u093e\\u0928\\u0940 \\u091c\\u093e\\u0928\\u0947 \\u0935\\u093e\\u0932\\u0940 \\u0932\\u093f\\u0932\\u0940 \\u0910\\u0938\\u093e \\u0938\\u0902\\u0917\\u0940\\u0924 \\u092c\\u0928\\u093e\\u0924\\u0940 \\u0939\\u0948\\u0902 \\u091c\\u094b \\u0926\\u0930\\u094d\\u0936\\u0915\\u094b\\u09