0153uvres d\'art classiques, de r\\u00e9imaginer des styles r\\u00e9tro ou de cr\\u00e9er des playlists r\\u00e9tro, le travail de James capture l\'essence des \\u00e9poques r\\u00e9volues tout en les rendant pertinentes et passionnantes pour le public d\'aujourd\'hui.\\r\\n\\r\\nConvaincu que le pass\\u00e9 est une source d\'inspiration sans fin, James White est un guide de confiance pour tous ceux qui cherchent \\u00e0 red\\u00e9couvrir le charme de la culture r\\u00e9tro. \\u00c0 travers ses projets, ses ateliers et ses collaborations, James invite tout le monde \\u00e0 se joindre \\u00e0 la c\\u00e9l\\u00e9bration de tout ce qui est vintage, prouvant que la vieille \\u00e9cole ne se d\\u00e9mode jamais."}},"id":"66050b599df4d","image":"6a8d8ae9-1691-4ae0-922a-b0b8f782c5d0.webp","social_links":[{"id":"66050b59a80a5","icon_image":"b6e1fff8-c239-43bc-af67-3b7af1536de7.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/"},{"id":"66050b59aaae0","icon_image":"24c16ce0-158a-4720-9771-c92ab2010aee.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/twitter.com\\/"},{"id":"66050b59ae3db","icon_image":"b3dae1f1-f39f-43d1-9493-e93432ffac65.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/"},{"id":"66050b59b1727","icon_image":"7d2d6d3c-2187-4705-823d-4d276a7e93d6.webp","link":"https:\\/\\/www.tiktok.com\\/"}]},"66050bd62e2b7":{"language":{"en":{"item_name":"Rachel Hayes","item_designation":"Afternoon Grooves Mav","item_about":"Rachel Hayes is a dynamic music curator and DJ known for her smooth, soulful, and rhythm-driven sets. As the \\"Afternoon Grooves Mav,\\" Rachel has mastered the art of crafting the perfect soundtrack to accompany the midday sun, blending a mix of mellow beats, funky rhythms, and uplifting melodies that set the tone for a relaxing yet energizing afternoon.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith a deep love for diverse genres\\u2014ranging from jazz and funk to R&B and chill house\\u2014Rachel\\u2019s music creates an atmosphere where listeners can unwind while staying engaged. Whether curating playlists for laid-back events, hosting live DJ sets, or collaborating with artists, Rachel\\u2019s ability to bring the perfect groove to any afternoon has made her a sought-after presence in the music scene.\\r\\n\\r\\nRachel believes in the power of music to create moments of connection and serenity. Through her afternoon grooves, she continues to inspire listeners to embrace the flow of the day with ease and style."},"es":{"item_name":"Raquel Hayes","item_designation":"Tarde Grooves Mav","item_about":"James White es un visionario creativo dedicado a traer el pasado al presente con estilo y elegancia. Como \\"especialista en resurgimiento retro\\", James insufla nueva vida a las tendencias, el arte y la cultura atemporales, organizando experiencias que celebran las eras doradas del dise\\u00f1o, la m\\u00fasica y la moda.\\r\\n\\r\\nCon un ojo agudo para los detalles y una pasi\\u00f3n inquebrantable por la nostalgia, James es conocido por combinar la est\\u00e9tica vintage con sensibilidades modernas. Ya sea restaurando obras de arte cl\\u00e1sicas, reinventando estilos retro o organizando listas de reproducci\\u00f3n retro, el trabajo de James captura la esencia de \\u00e9pocas pasadas y al mismo tiempo las hace relevantes y emocionantes para el p\\u00fablico actual.\\r\\n\\r\\nJames White, un firme creyente de que el pasado contiene una inspiraci\\u00f3n infinita, es un gu\\u00eda de confianza para cualquiera que busque redescubrir el encanto de la cultura retro. A trav\\u00e9s de sus proyectos, talleres y colaboraciones, James invita a todos a unirse a la celebraci\\u00f3n de todo lo vintage, demostrando que la vieja escuela nunca pasa de moda."},"hi":{"item_name":"\\u0930\\u093e\\u091a\\u0947\\u0932 \\u0939\\u0947\\u0938","item_designation":"\\u0926\\u094b\\u092a\\u0939\\u0930 \\u0917\\u094d\\u0930\\u0942\\u0935\\u094d\\u0938 \\u092e\\u093e\\u0935","item_about":"\\u091c\\u0947\\u092e\\u094d\\u0938 \\u0935\\u094d\\u0939\\u093e\\u0907\\u091f \\u090f\\u0915 \\u0930\\u091a\\u